          "quote": "After milling, the alloyed powders were transferred into a 14 mm inner diameter graphite die set and consolidated into cylindrical bulk pellets using an MTI Corporation OTF-1200X-VHP3 hot press with a vertical vacuum-sealed quartz tube furnace and a hydraulic press. Cold pressing was first performed under 25 MPa and room temperature for 10 min, followed by hot pressing.",
